<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Uyaku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur uwu Uyaku</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uyaku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Uyak</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur uwu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uyaku</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur Uyaku</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Uyaku Atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Abɔɔ akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ra amɛk aki 45-50 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu. Utsutson udɛyiwe ugɛ Uyaku uner uwuku utsɛng ubvur uwurɛ awu ungwɛ̃mbɔ Uyesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13:35">Umat 13.35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Umar 6.3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Uyaku atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ amesuwe &lt;&lt;abika adɔsu Uyesu anui usɔkdũmɛn hã aka asita amaa upfunga.&gt;&gt; Uner uwuku utsɛng ubvur ha akũ irhɛm arherhe arhɛrhɛ amesuwe imesi itsoi nu imesi iyiki ikpɔm amɛn abika adɔsa nu ikikorhambɔ. Unga amesuwe itsi arherhe arhɛrhɛ ri itsi abika adɔsa. Itsi arherhe ha iwu iwe ru ubin nu isheru ubin, iviviri, amɛn aka aze, amɛn aka abewe, imangmang nu ikikorhe, itser arhɛm, itsoi, ifuw, iberi itsi nu irhɛrhi itsi, itsu uvau ra abɔɔ, igbana, idɔngamɛn, nu ifɛn-Num.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubvur ha idɛyiwe ugarh ukpu imangmang nggu itser, nu imesi iyi ibibɛk iyi abika adɔsa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:1">1.1</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imangmang nu itsoi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1.2-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iwe ru ubin nu isheru ubin <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1.9-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iviviri <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:12-18">1.12-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Igigũ nu ikikorhe <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 1:19-27">1.19-27</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Igbiir ato ri itsi isɛng asu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imangmang nu itser <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2.14-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uner uwuku udɔsa nu urhɛmnga <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 3:1-18">3.1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Uner uwuku udɔsa nu upfung <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 4:1-5:6">4.1—5.6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imesa iyɔɔ <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5.7-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Ighwe idzeku Uyaku ugãrhã Unum nu uwu Uteijee Uyesu Ukiristo. Izĩ ra abika adɔsu Uyesu anui usɔkdũmɛn hã aka asita amaa upfunga.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iviviri nu andeya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Àka anyanga ake awe abin anggɔm, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ivangyɛ ikpũ andeya arhɛrhɛ aka ikpo umbi, <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi iviviri imangmangmbi ngge itsú ibibimambi. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Àka amesa ibima ru ubɛn ubin ngge itsú umbi akɔ̃ na awe undzumunga, asi íshembi ru ubin. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Unera ru umbi aba abeenga itsoi, unga arhusu Unum, uwuku udzowe izũwã ru kishoo na asi ibeenga uvau, awuri idzowuka unga. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Bɔr ivangyɛ unga aka irhusa, awu ufang unga awe ru imangmang asi ícanga. Ubinkutsu, uner uwuku ucang awe ru nyaki ibɔrh amɛ̃ ukau ukugɔng, ukukom iki iyii ni idzui ukau ha. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Ikpũ uner ha niba akaka ifɛrhkɔ iyɛi ubɛn ubin ru Uteijee. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Unga awu uner amɛn avaa, asi ingwɛ̃ɛ̃ amɛnnga ananga unying ri ikikorhanga.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwe ru ubin nu itsũwã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Uneke uwuku udɔsu Uyesu aka awu utsũwã afĩrhã ugɛ ra asu Unum unga awu nggaa uner. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Bɔr uwuku uwe ru ubin afĩrhã ugɛɛ unga asi iwea ubin ra asu Unum, ubinkutsu unga awuri ikikoyi ru nyaka ífur ubĩĩ. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Ivang ishaa unum iba idzek imani iki isaki itsu ífur ubĩĩ ukoyi igba nu izengge igwirngge. Rimi hã uner ubin aka ikpe ru uzɛ̃rhãnga ukpu igoyi igoi.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayetnum nu iviviri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Idorh iwe iyi unerwi aka abima ri iviviri, ubinkutsu unga aba ananga ivivira ha, awuri iyɛsa itosa urhɛ Unum aka abemuwe kishoo abika abema unga.<verse eid="JAS 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Ivang undeya uba uwemgbɔ, unera niba agɔra agɛ, &lt;&lt;Unum unga andeya umum.&gt;&gt; Ubinkutsu, asi íkũ iki ibewe adeyimbɔ Unum, ikɛi unga nibikanga asi ídeyinga unera. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Bɔr undeya iwuri ibamgbɔ ru unera ri ivangyɛ ikponi iyiki ibewe iki irhɛm unga, ihwa itsinga. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Mɔcɛ ikponi iyiki ibewe iba itsĩ ru unera, iki isaki imar arhim. Ivang arhim aka iseng amaa, ake amar akpe.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Umbi aze angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, niba arhɛmmbɔ umbi. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Ubɛn izũwã iyiki ize nu undzumu izũwã idzeka afafã, idzeku Utɛ uwuku umunu írhirhang ra afã. Unga asi ífarunga ru nyaku uzirhzĩ uku idziu. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Unga asɛng imarmɛn ri irhɛm idzidzɛrhe, ugɛ umɛn ima iwe íkpũrhã inggbaashi ugarh ra abina kishoo unga aka amuna.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikpe ato nu ikikorhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Umbi aze angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka ahwɛng ugɛ ubɛn unera afɛ̃rhĩ igigũ, bɔr niba azanga arherhe, na azanga igũ avɔm. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Ubinkutsu, unera asi íkũ avɔmnga akorhunga abin aka arhurhika Unum aka abee. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Nggee, àka atare ubɛn amɛn ishĩ hã aki arhim nu urhɛrhɛ ibewe iki imaa ananga, àka angwɛ̃dzɛn na ayɛi irhɛm hã umbɔ aka adoi ra amɛnmbi, iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ akũ umbi izĩ ififɔrh.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Niba agũ irhɛm ukpekũ na arhɛmmbi atsimbi. Àka atɔ̃ itser nggu ngge. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Ubɛn uner uwuku ugũ urhɛm na asi itɔ̃ɔ̃ itser nggu ukpɔ, awu ru nyaku unerwi aki irhi asunga ri irhi. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Unga anyã itsinga na azɛ̃rhã azĩã, kanying na ayiruka ikpũ unyɛ̃ɛ̃nga uku uwe. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Bɔr unerwi aka angwɛ̃dzɛn na arhi uku kpengkpeng ikpem iyiki idzowe ukam, na akorha ake, asi iyiruka ubinkpi unga aka agũ, bɔr atɔ̃ itser nggu ake, awuri itsukukumbɔ unga idorh ru ubinkpi unga aka ikorhe.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Unera aba akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ unga awu uner agbeyi na asi ikpɔma arhɛmnga, arhɛm itsinga, agbeyanga awu ibɛm. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Agbeyakɛ Unum Utɛmɛn aka iyɛi ru nyaki isisar aki idzidzɛrhe awu riminɛ, akika afuka atsɛ̃rhãpfu, nu angwɛ̃rhãpfu ra ayetnummbɔ, na asi ineke abin upfung adakuke unga.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Àka aneke itɛngasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ru nyaka abi imangmang ru Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo, Uteijee ikpikpoi, àka aneke itɛngasu. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Agɛ unera atsĩwã ri ikikɔngmbi, atsu imang uzinarhi ri itoknga nu atorho aka aze nu utsũwã ikɛi atsĩwã nggu ashaka atorho. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Umbi aba adzowe uner uwuku utsim atorho aka aze ha imor ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Uba usei ra anang isei aka azea,&gt;&gt; bɔr umbi agɔr utsũwã hã agɛ, &lt;&lt;Udɛ̃ɛ̃ nggɔɔ,&gt;&gt; use &lt;&lt;Useisa abĩ ukhapa ra andaidakmum,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>umbi asi itɛngmbi asu nukpɔ na awu abika atsu uvau adɔkambi nggu ifɛrhkɔ iyiki ibewe?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Àka akpeto, aze angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, Unum asi isɛng atsũwã ra asu upfunga umbɔ awe abi ubin ri imangmang na anyangu ukam Iyɛrhe afã hã unga aka abemuwe abika abema unga? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Bɔr umbi arhena atsũwã. Asi iwea abika awe ru ubin ayɔm umbi? Asi iwea umbɔ aka isaka akũna umbi azĩ ukotu? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Asi iwea umbɔ aka isaka arheni itsok Uteijeembi uwuku uwu ru ugarh?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Umbi aba adɔsumbi Íkpem Iyɛrha ha ri itsɛng Arherhu-Num, aki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Ubemu udɔkango ru nyaki itsingo,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Urha 19.18</ref></char>.</note> ungo ukorhe uku urhirhiki nukpɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Bɔr umbi aba atɛngmbi asu, umbi awu ra arhim, umbi aka agba uvau izharhuwe Íkpem. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Ubɛn unerwi aka adɔsi Íkpem kishoo aba azharhuka unying, aka agba uvau azharhuwe kishoo nukpɔ. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Ubinkutsu uwuku ugɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba utomungo-dak,&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Idzi 20.14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Iva 5.18</ref></char>.</note> ikɛi agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Niba ufɛrɔ uner.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Idzi 20.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Iva 5.17</ref></char>.</note> Ungo uba usi itomungo-dak, bɔr ufɛrɔ unera, ungo uku uzharhuwe Íkpem nukpɔ.<verse eid="JAS 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Àka arherhe na akorhe ru nyaka abirabɛ aka itsu umbɔ uvau ri ikpem iyiki idzowe ukam. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Ubinkutsu Unum awuri izharha arherhe iyiki isheru atorh ra abirabɛ aka ashimbɔ ra atorh. Bɔr atorh awuri inangke itsu uvau.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imangmang nu ikikorhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Awu use uwu izea, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, unera aba agɔr ugɛ unga awea ri imangmang bɔr asi ikorhunga ngge? Ikpũ imangmang hã iwuri ifɔrhngge unga? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Uba ungwɛ̃mbi use unapumbi ashia ra atorho use ubingha, <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>unying ru umbi aba agɔr unga agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uzĩ uku utɔɔ, Unum ama adzaa ubinkpi ungo uku itsim nu ugha,&gt;&gt; bɔr asi ikorhukanga ubinkpi unga aka abee, awu use izea? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Rimi hã, imangmang nibikangge, unera aba asi ikũ atɔ̃ɔ̃ itser nggu ngge, iki ikpengge.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Bɔr uwɔɔ awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ungo uwe ru imangmang, umum iwe ru ikikorhe.&gt;&gt; Udɛyiwa imangmango iyiki ishingge ri ikikorhe, umum idɛyiwa imangmangmum ri ikikorhamum. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Ungo uweɔ ri imangmang ugɛ Unum awu unying. Aze! Uko ípfu iyiki ibewe iwengge ri imangmang rimi hã, na atsu umbɔ agũ iwei ayormbɔ azang.<verse eid="JAS 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Ungo ugugge uner, ungo ubee umbɔ adɛyiwa ungo imangmang iki ishingge ri itser iwu ibɛm? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Asi iwea itser utokamɛn Uibrahim aka adzowe ungwɛ̃nga Uishaku ru ubeu idɛm-Num, itsu umbɔ anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Ungo unyaɔ imangmangnga iki izɛ̃rhã nggu ikikorhanga itsu imangmangnga iwe undzumunga ri ikikorhanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Ngge itsuifɛr itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Uibrahim aka awe ru imangmang ru Unum itsu Unum anyanga unga awu uner uwuku urhika.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ing 15.6</ref></char>.</note> Ngge itsu umbɔ ayisa unga uwɛrhu Unum. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Umbi anyãnɛ, asi ínyangu unera awea uner uwuku urhika ru ubok imangmang ukpekũ, bɔr ru ubok itsernga ikɛi.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Rimi hã, umbɔ aka anyangu Urahab unggoyi ha awu uner uwuku urhika ru ubok ubinkpi unga aka akorhe, ri ivangyɛ unga aka awɔke abika arhi anang hã, na adene umbɔ adɔsu utsĩndĩ uwukuse <verse eid="JAS 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Ru nyaka iyor iki ishingge ru ipfu ngge iki ikpengge, iwe rimi hã imangmang iki ishingge ri ikikorhe iki ikpengge.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ikpɔm arhɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Asi iwea irhɛmbi aka iwe abika amesuwe, umbi aze angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ umɛn abika amesuwe awuri izharha arherhamɛn anangmbɔ abɔɔ. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Umɛn kishoo igbeimɛn irhak ra atsĩndĩã arhɛrhɛ. Unera aba asi igbaa irhak ru ubinkpi unga aka arherhe, unga awu undzumu uner uwuku udɛ̃ɛ̃ akpɔm iyornga kishoo.<verse eid="JAS 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Nggu ungwɛ̃rhũ unangga umɛn iki itsu ra angwĩ inyãwã, ni idɛ̃ɛ̃ idzui iyorngge kishoo izĩ anangkɛ umɛn iki ibee. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Use unyangu akhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ akpanga. Nggakɛ ake awu agɔgɔngake, ugba ukerketakpɔ iki isaku ukũna ake uzɛ̃rhũ uzɛ̃rhã. Uko rimi hã, nggu ungwɛ̃rhũ igbong ukunjiir uner uwuku ukpai ukhukhɔɔ amɛ̃ hã aka isaka adzipa umgbɔ akũ azĩ ubɛn anangkɛ unga aka abee izĩ. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Rimi hã arhɛm unera ukunjiir aka awe ra agau iyor, bɔr awu ru nggaa ififĩrhã. Àka anyã ishi urha ukunjiir iki ikpĩĩwe akoi kishoo! <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Arhɛm ikɛi awu urha. Awu nggu iki ibewe ra agau iyor. Aka isaka adakuwe unera kishoo. Aka isaka atsu ibibɛknga kishoo itsĩ ru urha. Urhakpi arhɛm aka awe adzeki idzũũ urha isok upfung.<verse eid="JAS 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Unera adɛ̃ɛ̃ akpɔma ikpũ íjuɛ kishoo, nu anunu akika asoyi afafã nu abin aka akaikai nu abɛrh ra ukau ukugɔng, <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>bɔr unera asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ akpɔma arhɛmnga. Arhɛm awu ubin uku ubewe asi iwoshuke. Atɔk nggu ungguma uwuku ufɛr uner.<verse eid="JAS 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Nggu arhɛm umɛn iki ikũ ikpoi Uteijee aka awu Utɛmɛn, nu nggu ake umɛn iki ikũ irhena anera Unum aka amuna ru uzirhzĩnga. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Nggu angwĩã unying umɛn iki ikũ ikpoi ni irhena. Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, akɛrɛ isi imɛ̃ngge ngge iwe. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Akwiu amɛ̃ unying udɛ̃ɛ̃ udzowukpɔ amɛ̃ aka aze nu amɛ̃ aka akpere? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, ucucii uvorhvo udɛ̃ɛ̃ ughwɛrmgbɔ ikpũrhã uzaitun use ucucii inebi udɛ̃ɛ̃ ughwɛrmgbɔ ikpũrhã uvorhvo? Rimi hã akwiu amɛ̃ aka awu uku ukpere asi ídɛ̃ɛ̃ adzeke amɛ̃ aka aze.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Itsoi ikpũa ivaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Ungamɔ awe ru itsoi nu ihwihwɛng ru umbi? Uneke unga adɛyiwengge ri ibibɛknga iyiki ize, nu itser iyiki ize nggu ididɔɔryɛ iki idzeki itsoi. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Bɔr uba ra amɛnmbi unyɛ̃ɛ̃ akarhãrhã nggu ibemitsi iwengge, àka aneke ikũ ngge afĩrhã use atsɛyi idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Ikpũ itsoi iyɛrɛ isi idzengge ra afã. Idzeku upfung. Isi iwengge iyi Ipfu Isarsatangge, bɔr iwu iyi Undenggũ. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Ubinkutsu anangkɛ unyɛ̃ɛ̃ uku uwe nu ibemitsi, umɔ ishɔng arherhe nu ubɛn iyiki ibewe iki iwe.<verse eid="JAS 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Bɔr itsoiyɛ iki idzeka afã itirhi iwu isaisar, ikɛi ibemungge ididɔɔr, itɛnamɛn, irhɛrhi itsingge, itɔk nggu atorh nu ikikorhe iyiki ize. Ishingge ri itɛngasu use igha urha. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Uner uwuku ududɔɔr adoi ididɔɔr na aka isaka agbɛr irhirhika.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Udzowe itsingo ru Unum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Awu use ukũ ifuw nu uning uba ru umbi? Asi idzekake ri ikponi iyiki ibewambi iki itang iwa ru umbi? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Umbi abee ubin bɔr asi ikpombi ukpɔ. Umbi afɛr na akãrhã, bɔr umbi asi idɛ̃ɛ̃ akpombi ubinkpi umbi aka abee. Umbi awu ru uning na afupa. Umbi asi ikpombi, ubinkutsu, umbi asi irhusumbi Unum. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Ivangyɛ umbi aka irhusa, umbi asi iyɛimbi, ubinkutsu, umbi arhusa nggu ifɛrhkɔ iyiki ibewe, ngge itsú umbi afɛre ngge ri igũibɛnmbi.<verse eid="JAS 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Umbi abi itser itoma-dak, umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ugɛ iwɛrhɛ nggu upfung iwu igamtsak nggu Unum? Ubɛn unera aka abee iwe ri iwɛrhɛ nggu upfung awu unggamtsak Unum. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Umbi akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ awu ibɛm itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ, &lt;&lt;Unum akpɔm Ipfu ha unga aka atsu ru umɛn? <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Bɔr unga aka isaka adzaa umɛn imimuta irhɛirhɛ. Ru nyaku itsɛng Arherhu-Num iki igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">&lt;&lt;Unum akpɛ̃ɛ̃ uwuku ufĩrhã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">bɔr adzowe imimuta ru uwuku urhɛrhi itsi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">&lt;&lt;Unum akpɛ̃ɛ̃ uner uwuku uberitsi.&gt;&gt;</char></note><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Uny 3.34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Nggee, àka adzowe atsimbi kishoo ru Unum. Àka akpɛ̃ Undenggũ, unga awuri itĩã umbi. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Àka aba akhapa ru Unum unga awuri iba akhapunga ru umbi, àka asorh abokmbi, umbi abi arhim, àka asare amɛnmbi, umbi abi amɛn avaa. <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Àka agũ ighongamɛn, aciu na adɔng. Àka afaru unyĩrhãmbi uwe akpe, nu anggɔmmbi abvui awe idamɛn. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Àka arhɛrhuwe atsimbi ra asu Uteijee, unga awuri iberuwa umbi.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, niba acayimbi adɔka. Ubɛn unera aka acayi ungwɛ̃mbɔ use unapumbɔ, use atsu uvau ru unga, acayi Íkpem Unum nukpɔ na atsu uvau ru ngge. Ivangyɛ ungo uku utsu uvau ri Íkpem, ungo usi idɔsungo ngge, bɔr ungo utsu uvau ri ngge. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Unum ikiyikanga adzowe Ikpem na atsu uvau, unga ikiyikanga adɛ̃ɛ̃ afɔrh na atsĩme. Bɔr ungo uwe ungamɔ ungo uku itsu uvau ru udɔkango?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ififĩrhã nggu udãã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Àka akpeto, umbi abika agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Irherɛ use udãã umɛn izĩ uteu ukpɛrɛ use ukpɔrɔ, izĩ imaa amɛka umɔ, igoyi igoi ni ikpo uhwɛk.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Umbi asi ihwɛngmbi ubinkpi uku iwe udã. Awu use uwu urhɛmbi? Awu ubinkpi uku uwe ru nyaku uziu uku idzeka ri ivanga ukunjiir nu ugwirkpɔ. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, imɛ̃ɛ̃ngge umbi awuri igɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Uteijee aba abemunga, umɛn ibɛk, umɛn ikorhe akɛrɛ use akɔrɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Bɔr nggayɛ icɛrɛ, umbi afĩrhã na abera atsimbi. Ikpũ ififĩrhã hã iwu iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="JAS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Ubɛn unera aka ahwɛnga ubin uku uze unga aka ikorhe na asi ikikorhunga, awu arhim ru unga.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Agbiite ato abika awe ru ubin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Àka akpeto, umbi abika awu ru ubin, àka aciu akpe na adɔng ri itsi ayetnumkɛ aka iba ru umbi. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Abinmbi aka avɔ̃ke, nu ughɛ̃ɛ̃ uku ughamgbɔ atorhambi. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Uzinarhimbi nu uazurhfambi aka adzurhke. Idzidzurhngge iwuri iwu ideka ra atsimbi, iwuri ikpĩĩwe iyor umbi ru nyaku urha. Umbi akɔnge atsimbi abin ri imimasha ínum. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Àka anyã! Ugbɛta ha umbi aka akpɛ̃ ifai abi itser ri icangmbi, aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ iciu akpe ra atsimbi. Akpe abika agbɛra abin icangmbi aka atsĩke ra ato Uteijee uwu ijee kishoo. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Umbi asei igũibɛn ru upfung, umbi agha na ahwa ri ibibemambi. Umbi afuka atsimbi atsu ayormbi aseng agɔgɔng ru nyaki ijuɛ iki itsĩ unum ukpuku ungũngwã. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Umbi atsu ufai na afɛre anera aka ashimbɔ ru uvau, aka asi ikpɛ̃mbɔ ra umbi.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Idɔngamɛn ra ayetnum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Àka adɔng amɛnmbi, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, utsɛku ibiba Uteijee. Àka anyã uner irham aki idzɛu icangnga iki ighwɛr abin unga aka adoi, nggu urhɛrhɛ idɔngamɛn unga adzɛu inai iyiki idoi abin utsɛku inai iyi imaataka. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Umbi igambi, àka adɔng na adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker, ubinkutsu ibiba Uteijee iki iyongge.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka niba ibvun arherhe ri itsi adɔka, utsur umbɔ atsumbɔ uvau ru umbi. Uner uwuku utsu uvau ha adɛ̃ɛ̃ ra angwĩ ubã!<verse eid="JAS 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka anyã abika asɔm Arherhu-Num aki irherhe ri itsok Uteijee aka abima ra ayetnum. Àka amesa ru umbɔ. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Ru nyaka umbi aka ahwɛng, umɛn iki isaki iyisa abika abubima awu abi idorh. Umbi agũmbi ikpũ ibibima Uayuba na anyãmbi abinkɛ Uteijee aka akorhuwe ri imaatak. Uteijee atɔk nggu atorh.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Ubin uku unang kishoo, umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, àka niba ayirhmbi uyirh nggu afã, use nggu abĩ, use ubin ukpɔɔ. Àka agɔr agɛ, &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ&gt;&gt;, iba iwu &lt;&lt;Ĩĩ&gt;&gt; na agɔr agɛ &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ&gt;&gt; iba iwu &lt;&lt;Ĩ'ĩ,&gt;&gt; iba isi iwengge rimi, umbi awuri itsĩmbi ufai ukpu Unum.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Uner ayetnum awea ru umbi? Unga afɛn-Num. Uner anggɔm awea? Neke unga atsũ ubom ikpikpoi. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Uner irhãrhã awea ru umbi? Unga ayisa akakũ ikikɔng abika adɔsa umbɔ afɛne-Num ru unga, na adzukuwe atsei ru unga ri itsok Uteijee. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Ikpũ ifɛn-Num ri imangmang iwuri ikerhukungge uner irhãrhã. Uteijee awuri iberuka unga. Unga aba awea ra arhim awuri itsitsũwũkumbɔ ake. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Nggee àka asɔme adɔkambi arhimmbi, na ifɛne-Num ra adɔka nu umbɔ ama akerhuwa umbi. Ifɛn-Num iyi uner uwuku urhika iwe ru ijee nu iker iyiki itɔ̃ itser.<verse eid="JAS 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Uirhiya awu unera ru nyaka umɛn. Unga ifɛn-Num akarhãrhã utsur inai idoingge, ikɛi inai isi idoingge nu abĩ utsɛku imɛka itaar nu utenga. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Ikɛi unga afɛn-Num, afã adzowe inai, nu abĩ aghwɛr ikpũrhã.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Umbi angwɛ̃mɛn nu anapumɛn, uba ubɛn unera ru umbi nekuka utsĩndĩ idzidzɛrhe, ubɛn unera ru umbi aba azĩ akũna unga abvui aba <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>àka ayita ugɛ ubɛn uwuku ukunu uner arhim abvui aba ru utsĩndĩ idzidzɛrhe, unga awuri ifɔrhuka uner ha ra akpe na akũ utsĩndĩ uwuku utsũwe arhɛrha arhim.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
